  "title": "ECMF02-2AMX6 Pin3 to Connector GND or the System GND?",
  "content": "<p>ECMF02-2AMX6 has only one pin for the GND connection, which is unusual.</p><p>Where should this pin3 (GND) be connected to? the connector GND or the system GND? </p><p>I have common mode choke between the connector GND and the System GND. </p><p> </p><p>Based on the dot notation on the common mode choke, I assumed pin 5 and pin6 should be connected to the connector side so pin3 should be connected to the system GND?</p>",
